#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Noodhku wuu isbeddelay ka dib markii bogga la soo bandhigay, sidaas darteed waxba lama samayn. Dib u eeg oo mar kale isku day."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not allow changing this record."
msgstr "Ogolaanshahaaga qalabka ma oggola in la beddelo diiwaankan."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Name: another fabric already uses this name."
msgstr "Magaca: fabric kale ayaa horay u isticmaalaya magacan."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Adapter: another fabric already sweeps this adapter port on this poller. One fabric per adapter port."
msgstr "Adapter: fabric kale ayaa horay u baarayay dekeddan adapter-ka ee poller-kan. Hal fabric halkii deked adapter."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "Fabric-ga lama kaydin karin."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "Fabric-ga waa la kaydiyay."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Baaritaan ku saabsan fabric-gan ayaa socda, sidaas darteed waxba lama tirtirin. Mar kale isku day marka uu dhammaado."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "Fabric-ga iyo liiska agabkiisa waa la tirtiray. Wax qalab Cacti ah lama beddelin, fabric-gana laguma xirin."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "Fabric-ga lama tirtiri karin."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "Aqoonsiga noodhka lama beddelin."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was updated. It is swept again from the next cycle."
msgstr "Aqoonsiga noodhka waa la cusboonaysiiyay. Waxaa dib loo baari doonaa wareegga xiga."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device mapping moved to the new node."
msgstr "Ku-xirnaanta qalabka waxaa loo raray noodhka cusub."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be confirmed. The nodes may have changed since it was made."
msgstr "Soo-jeedinta lama xaqiijin karin. Waxaa laga yaabaa in noodhadhku isbeddeleen tan iyo markii la sameeyay."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be rejected."
msgstr "Soo-jeedinta lama diidi karin."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal was rejected."
msgstr "Soo-jeedinta waa la diiday."

