msgstr "Wax qalab ah lama abuurin. Eeg diiwaanka Cacti."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device was created and the node mapped to it. Choose the ports to graph on the New Graphs page."
msgstr "Qalabka waa la abuuray, noodhkana waa lagu xiray. Ka dooro dekedaha la sawirayo bogga New Graphs."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The inventory could not be read for export."
msgstr "Liiska agabka lama akhrin karin si loo dhoofiyo."

