#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Fabric templates are not installed. Reinstall them from the health page."
msgstr "Qaababka Fabric lama rakibin. Dib uga rakib bogga caafimaadka."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Noodhku wuxuu horay ugu xiran yahay qalab."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node's fabric is not swept by the main poller, so its device could not be polled."
msgstr "Fabric-ga noodhka ma baaro main poller-ka, sidaas darteed qalabkiisa lama baari karin."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device does not exist."
msgstr "Qalabku ma jiro."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device is polled by another poller than the one that sweeps this fabric, so it could not read the fabric cache."
msgstr "Qalabka waxaa baara poller ka duwan kan baara fabric-gan, sidaas darteed ma akhrin karin kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee fabric-ga."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, host name %s, polled by poller %d, with availability checks and SNMP off."
msgstr "Qalab \"%s\" ah oo ka yimid qaabka qalabka %s, magaca martigeliyaha %s, oo uu baaro poller %d, iyadoo hubinta helitaanka iyo SNMP ay dansan yihiin."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The %s data query on it, listing the node's ports. It creates no graph and no data source by itself."
msgstr "Weydiinta xogta %s ee ku jirta, taas oo taxaysa dekedaha noodhka. Kaligeed ma abuurto sawir-garaaf ama il xog."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Fabric plugin for node %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Waxaa u abuuray plugin-ka Fabric noodhka %s. Qiimaheedu waxay ka yimaadaan kaydka plugin-ka; magaca martigeliyaha waa magac gaar ah oo aan waligiis lala xiriirin."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, spaces, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Magaca: isticmaal 1 ilaa 64 xaraf, tirooyin, meelo banaan, dhibco, jiitinno, ama hoos-xarriiqyo, adigoo ku bilaabaya xaraf ama tiro."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Backend: choose one of the listed backends."
msgstr "Backend: ka dooro mid ka mid ah backend-yada liiska ku jira."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: ka dooro mid ka mid ah poller-rada liiska ku jira."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: only the main poller can sweep a fabric until remote poller support is added."
msgstr "Poller: kaliya main poller-ka ayaa baari kara fabric ilaa taageerada remote poller la daro."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Sweep Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Muddada Baaritaanka: geli ilbiriqsiyo dhan oo u dhexeeya %d ilaa %d."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Adapter: enter the local adapter name as the kernel names it, such as mlx5_0."
msgstr "Adapter: geli magaca adapter-ka maxalliga ah sida kernel-ku u magacaabo, sida mlx5_0."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Adapter Port: enter the port number of the local adapter, from 1 to %d."
msgstr "Dekedda Adapter-ka: geli lambarka dekedda ee adapter-ka maxalliga ah, laga bilaabo 1 ilaa %d."

