#: lib/InventoryPage.php
msgid "Transmit wait counts ticks in which a port had data to send but could not send it, for lack of credits or arbitration. A high value shows congestion toward the remote end; it does not show that the port or its cable is faulty. The tick length is not published for current link speeds, so values are ticks per second, not time."
msgstr "Sugitaanka gudbinta wuxuu tiriyaa ticks-ka ay dekeddu haysatay xog la diro laakiin aysan diri karin, sababtoo ah credit la'aan ama garsoor la'aan. Qiime sare wuxuu muujinayaa ciriiri xagga dhammaadka fog ah; ma muujinayo in dekeddu ama fiiladeedu ay khaldan tahay. Dhererka tick-ga looma daabicin xawaaraha xiriirka ee hadda jira, sidaas darteed qiimayaashu waa ticks ilbiriqsigiiba, ma aha waqti."

