#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Baaritaanku wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa sida root. Ku socodsii ururiyaha koonto aan mudnaan sare lahayn oo leh ogolaansho akhris ah oo ku wajahan qalabka umad iyada oo loo marayo koox."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "Qalab baaris ah ayaa leh bit-ka setuid ama setgid. Kordhintu weligeed uma baahna."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "Qalab baaris ah ama galkiisa waxaa wax ku qori kara koonto aan ahayn mulkiilaha, ama koontada ururiyaha. Ciddii wax ku qori karta ayaa doorata waxa ururiyuhu socodsiiyo."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "Qalab umad ah waxaa akhrin kara ama wax ku qori kara koonto kasta, sidaas darteed isticmaale kasta oo gudaha ah wuxuu waydiin karaa fabric-ga. Ku xaddid koox."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Digniin aan la aqoon"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Qalabka Baarista"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Gal buuxa, oo ku yaalla ururiye kasta oo baara fabric, kuna jiraan perfquery, ibnetdiscover, iyo iblinkinfo. Xirmooyinka Debian iyo Ubuntu waxay ku rakibaan /usr/sbin. Barnaamij kale weligii lagama dhex socodsiiyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Galka Qalabka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Khariidadda Magacyada Noodhadhka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Waddo buuxda oo ikhtiyaari ah oo tagta faylka khariidadda magacyada noodhka ee infiniband-diags. Magacyada uu bixiyo waa la muujiyaa oo keliya; aqoonsigu had iyo jeer waa GUID-da noodhka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Wakhtiga Dhammaadka Datagram-ka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Mili-ilbiriqsiyada uu datagram kasta oo maamul ah qaadan karo ka hor inta aysan qalabku isku dayin mar kale (ikhtiyaarkooda -t)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Wakhtiga Dhammaadka Amarka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu hal socodsiin qalab qaadan karo ka hor inta aan la joojin oo aan loo diiwaangelin inuu guuldarraystay."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB oo hal socodsiin qalab daabici karto. Soo-saarka ka weyn waa la tuuraa waxaana loo diiwaangeliyaa inuu guuldarraystay."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Soo-saarka Ugu Badan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Baaritaan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Miisaaniyadda Wakhtiga Noodhka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu hal baaritaan noodh ku bixin karo akhrinta tiriyaasha. Dekedaha aan la gaarin waxaa la akhriyaa wareegga xiga."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Dekedaha guuldarraystay ee ka dib baaritaanka noodhku u joogsado wareeggan. Deked aan jawaabin waxay qaadataa dhowr ilbiriqsi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Miisaaniyadda Guuldarrooyinka Noodhka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Tusmee Dekedaha Hoos u Dhacay"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadeeyo, weydiinta xogta Fabric Port waxay sidoo kale taxdaa dekedaha hoos u dhacay ee aan lahayn dhinac fog, sida dekedaha adapter-ka ee aan la isticmaalin. Marka la tirtiro, waa laga tagaa ilaa ay ka soo kacaan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Ilaali Jadwalka Plugin-ka Marka La Saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadeeyo, ka-saarista kordhintu waxay haysaa fabric-yadeeda, diiwaanka hantida, iyo muunadaha. Tirtir si ka-saaristu u tirtirto; marka hore ka dhoofi diiwaanka hantida bogga Fabric Admin. Fabric-ga laguma xiriiro si kastaba ha ahaatee."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Galka qalabku waa inuu noqdaa waddo buuxda oo ka kooban xarfaha, tirooyinka, dhibcaha, xariiqyada dhexe, xariiqyada hoose, iyo xariiqyada qalloocan, iyada oo aan lahayn xariiq qalloocan oo dambe."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory does not exist or is not a directory."
msgstr "Galka qalabku ma jiro ama ma aha gal."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory path contains a symbolic link. Enter the real path."
msgstr "Waddada galka qalabku waxay ka kooban tahay xiriiriye astaan ah. Geli waddada dhabta ah."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory is not owned by root."
msgstr "Galka qalabka ma laha root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Galka qalabka waxaa wax ku qori kara kooxdiisa ama kuwa kale."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool is not owned by root."
msgstr "Qalab baaris ah ma laha root."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Qalab baaris ah waxaa wax ku qori kara kooxdiisa ama kuwa kale."

